t size=\"3\">관한 사항을 안내하오니 학위논문 심사에 합격한 2010학년도 전기 학위수</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">여 예정자분들은(2011. 2. 학위수여예정) 참고하여 주시기 바랍니다.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;1. 제출 기간 : <u><strong><font color=\"#0000ff\">2011. 1.12(수) ~14(금) [3일간]</font></strong></u></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;2. 제출 장소 : 각 학과(전공) 종합학사행정실</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;3. 제출 서류</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\